  "description": "The rainbow flag, prominently displayed in the image, is a globally recognized symbol of the LGBTQ+ Pride Movement. It represents the diversity and visibility of LGBTQ+ individuals and communities. Pride events are celebrations of LGBTQ+ identity and achievements, often accompanied by protests and activism for equal rights. The context of the image — two individuals joyfully participating in what appears to be a Pride event — relies on external knowledge of this movement to be fully understood.",
